00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.860
Most commentary treats TSLA's vehicles energy

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:29.060
and AI efforts as separate bets.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:32.140
The shared technology layers actually create

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:33.440
compounding advantages

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:35.620
that modular competitors struggle to match.

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:38.240
Owning the full hardware software

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:40.520
and energy loop shortens the iteration cycle

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:41.460
in meaningful ways,

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:44.420
each mile driven or kilowatt stored feeds data

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:45.720
that improves the whole system.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:47.520
This real world feedback loop

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:49.880
is the structural mode that is hard to replicate.

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:51.880
When you break it down to fundamentals,

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.100
the approach is to build

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:55.100
the cheapest reliable energy storage.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.060
Pair that with efficient vehicles

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:58.320
