00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:03.640
and the energy products in a continuous loop.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.420
There are no hand-offs between outside companies

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:07.680
or diluted incentives.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:10.280
The integration turns small improvements

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:13.420
in one area into large advantages across the board.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.820
The conventional view that Tesla is just an EV company

